{"Double interpolation vulnerability: applyTemplateVariables is called twice on the same targets (once here and once in runSplitQuery), which could cause incorrect expansion if a variable resolves to a value containing a $ character (e.g., a label value like $production)": 0.8457174301147461, "Consider either skipping interpolation in the first location and letting runSplitQuery handle it, or passing already-interpolated targets to runSplitQuery in a way that bypasses the second interpolation step": 0.8389875888824463}